&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;HighRadius, a renowned provider of cloud-based Autonomous Software for the Office of the CFO, has transformed critical financial processes for over 800+ leading companies worldwide.Trusted by prestigious organizations like 3M, Unilever, Anheuser-Busch InBev, Sanofi, Kellogg Company, Danone, Hershey&#39;s, and many others, HighRadius optimizes order-to-cash, treasury, and record-to-report processes, earning us back-to-back recognition in Gartner&#39;s Magic Quadrant and a prestigious spot in Forbes Cloud 100 List for three consecutive years.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With a remarkable valuation of $3.1B and an impressive annual recurring revenue exceeding $100M, we experience a robust year-over-year growth of 24%. With a global presence spanning 8+ locations, we&#39;re in the pre-IPO stage, poised for rapid growth. We invite passionate and diverse individuals to join us on this exciting path to becoming a publicly traded company and shape our promising future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job role : Senior Analyst – Strategic Alliances&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with the HighRadius leadership team in driving Partnership and Alliances strategy. You will be responsible for&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing Partner relationship and driving sales funnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting research and data analysis to plan and execute high level touchpoint campaigns with senior executives around the globe.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaisoning with internal / external stakeholders to collate information, deliver insights and work with the sales leaders in driving engagement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires a professional with high sales acumen, strong research, data analysis, and reporting experience. The individual should be able to communicate and engage with senior business leaders, and manage relationships independently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Desired Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduate / Post Graduate with 2-4 years of post qualification experience and exposure to research, data analysis, and stakeholder management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Focused on&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research skills and ability to use research tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business acumen and analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively collaborate with internal and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication skills, both written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and manage multiple initiatives in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Salesforce and office productivity tools is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in consulting / founder’s office / B2B SAAS pre-sales / marketing roles is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Get&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fun-filled work culture (https://www.highradius.com/culture/)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equal employment opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to build with a pre-IPO Global SaaS Centaur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
